# "When this Vehicle enters, destroy target nonland permanent an opponent controls with mana value 4 or less": Bot2's
# Bog Wraith (mana value exactly 4) is destroyed, the positive control, while it and Bot2's Mox Sapphire (mana value 0) are both legal, so the choice is asked, and Bot2's Swamp (a land) and Bot1's own Mox
# Jet are refused as targets. The cast costs exactly {2}{B}{B}{G}{G}: Swamp, Jet, Emerald and the Lotus's three green
# are six mana and the pool is empty right after the cast (CR 202.1, 601.2h); a Swamp is left untapped.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Black Lotus
Thundering Broodwagon
Swamp
Swamp
Swamp x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp
Black Lotus
Bog Wraith
Mox Sapphire
Swamp x3
Swamp x13

